    "url": "http://localhost:4000/ob-homepage/about",
    "title": "About Me",
    "body": "   I’m Oliver. I’m a researcher and designer who delivers design research. I bring design to complex social change and sustainability projects that involve tech, policy, services and systems. I use creative and diy methods, games and facilitation in my work, and talk software and data.    I currently do a patchwork of things between consultancy, academia and DIY:        👩‍🎤 Lancaster University - research fellow. sustainable futures and digital research infrastructure    🌀 fractals. coop - co-owner/worker, leading UCD and service evaluation consultancy, creative facilitation, climate futures conversations    📊 Cetis LLP - partner, edutech, data analysis, viz, carbon data      You can find my work in a bunch of different places:        👾 itch. io - my games, zines and diy stuff    ⚙️ Crank and File - gig economy cycle courier provocations and futures    🫖 Manky Tea Towel Museum - contribute your tea towels to the Manky Tea Towel Museum    🖥️ GitHub - a chaotic archive of code    📜 Google Scholar - academic outputs     Get in touchbluesky LinkedIn LinksYou can find me in other places! itch. io github  Google Scholar  substack "
